{"id":"januar","lemma":"Januar","pos":"noun","rank":3589,"glosses":["January (the first month of the Gregorian calendar, following the December of the previous year and preceding February)"],"ipa":"/ˈjanuaːr/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/13/De-Januar.ogg/De-Januar.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Januars","plural":"Januare"},"formAudio":{"Januars":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c8/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Sebastian_Wallroth-Januars.wav","Januare":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e2/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Sebastian_Wallroth-Januare.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Wir haben Schnee im Januar.","en":"We have snow in January.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"have"},{"g":"snow"},{"g":"in the"},null]},{"text":"Ich habe ihn im Januar kennengelernt.","en":"I met him in January.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"him"},{"g":"in the"},null,{"g":"to get to know","l":"kennenlernen"}]},{"text":"Im Januar ist es hier sehr kalt.","en":"It's very cold here in January.","words":[{"g":"in the"},null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"it"},{"g":"here"},{"g":"very"},{"g":"cold, chilly"}]},{"text":"Bei uns schneit es im Januar.","en":"It snows here in January.","words":[{"g":"at / with"},{"g":"us","l":"wir"},{"g":"to snow","l":"schneien"},{"g":"it"},{"g":"in the"},null]},{"text":"Der Januar ist der erste Monat des Jahres.","en":"January is the first month of the year.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/695535","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"first"},{"g":"month"},{"g":"of the","l":"der"},{"g":"year","l":"Jahr"}]}]}